### Valuations and Market Analysis

Valuation methods employed across our portfolio include discounted cash flows (DCF), comparable company analysis (CCA), and precedent transactions. For instance, Tech Innovations was valued using a DCF method, projecting a 20% annual growth rate. Green Energy Solutions was evaluated via CCA, benchmarked against similar renewable energy firms that recently went public.

In light of current market conditions, the technology sector continues to see high valuations, with an average EBITDA multiple of 12x for software companies. This trend bodes well for our portfolio, especially as we integrate emerging technologies from our acquisitions.

